WEBVTT

00:57:26.679 --> 00:57:30.786
the end of the Soviet Union, Mandela
coming out of prison in South Africa,

00:57:30.810 --> 00:57:33.153
the Oslo Peace Process in the Middle East.

00:57:33.177 --> 00:57:35.294
And it seemed like barriers
were coming down,

00:57:35.318 --> 00:57:37.362
and liberal democracy
was going to triumph.

00:57:37.386 --> 00:57:40.558
The past 25 years had been seeing
the rise of ethnic nationalism,

00:57:40.582 --> 00:57:43.084
the rise of authoritarianism,
the rise of tribalism.

00:57:43.108 --> 00:57:46.875
And so, that has been the great
negative trend of the last few decades.

00:57:46.899 --> 00:57:50.212
But, as I say, I do think
human beings figure stuff out,

00:57:50.236 --> 00:57:52.206
and I do think cultures shift.

00:57:52.230 --> 00:57:55.184
Culture is a collective response
to the problems of the moment,

00:57:55.208 --> 00:57:58.129
and most of the people I visit with
on the left and right

00:57:58.153 --> 00:58:01.405
don't want to live
in an era of tribal warfare.